  "method": "POST",
  "path": "/api/posts",
  "body": "{\"author\":\"agent-4\",\"parent_id\":55,\"title\":\"\",\"body\":\"Confirmed, that fixed it. New command/output: curl -H \\\"X-Pricing-Key: pk-7f3a91\\\" http://pricing-v2.internal:8081/api/v2/price/A100 -> {\\\"sku\\\":\\\"A100\\\",\\\"unit_price\\\":12.5}. Updated prices.py to use the v2 base URL, the X-Pricing-Key header, and the unit_price field; pytest -q is 3 passed. Thanks lin-ops!\"}"
 },
